<style>
:root{--plum:#24163A;--deep:#160C26;--coral:#FF6A3D;--gold:#FFB23F;--bg:#FBF3F7;--ink:#1E1633;--soft:#6E6585;--line:#EFE4EC}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--deep),var(--plum) 60%,#3A2556);color:#fff;padding:56px 22px 64px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,106,61,.35),transparent 65%);top:-160px;right:-160px}
.logo{width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--coral),var(--gold));display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 22px;font:600 42px Fraunces,serif;color:var(--plum)}
h1{font:600 56px/1 Fraunces,serif;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.tag{font:400 24px/1.25 Fraunces,serif;color:var(--gold);margin-top:10px}
.lead{max-width:460px;margin:18px auto 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:30px;padding:17px 30px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--coral),var(--gold));color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(255,106,61,.35);position:relative;z-index:1}
.meta{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);position:relative;z-index:1}
section{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 22px 8px}
h2{font:600 28px/1.2 Fraunces,serif;margin-bottom:16px}
.ladder{display:grid;gap:12px}
.rung{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(42,22,64,.06)}
.rung .e{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFE6DA;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:20px;flex:none}
.rung b{display:block;font-weight:600}.rung span{color:var(--soft);font-size:14px}
.shots{display:flex;gap:14px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding:4px 22px 18px;margin:0 -22px}
.shots img{height:440px;border-radius:26px;scroll-snap-align:center;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(42,22,64,.16);flex:none;background:#fff}
.cap{font-size:13px;color:var(--soft);margin:-4px 0 10px}
ol{padding-left:20px;line-height:1.6}ol li{margin-bottom:10px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(42,22,64,.06)}
.note{background:#FFF1D6;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:14px}
footer{text-align:center;color:var(--soft);font-size:13px;padding:40px 22px 60px}
.btn2{display:block;text-align:center;margin:26px auto 0;max-width:340px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="logo">R</div>
  <h1>Ranti</h1>
  <p class="tag">Never be the one who forgot.</p>
  <p class="lead">Ranti remembers the birthdays, anniversaries and big days of the people you love, and walks you to each one with time to plan.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="/ranti.apk" download="Ranti-0.1.apk">⬇&nbsp; Download for Android</a>
  <p class="meta">Version 0.1 · __SIZE__ · Android 7 and newer · free, no ads</p>
</header>

<section>
  <h2>How it keeps you ready</h2>
  <div class="ladder">
    <div class="rung"><div class="e">🌙</div><div><b>A question each night</b><span>Between 8 and 10pm: “Is there someone's birthday you'd like to remember?” One tap to add them.</span></div></div>
    <div class="rung"><div class="e">🎁</div><div><b>7 days before</b><span>Pick a gift while there's still time.</span></div></div>
    <div class="rung"><div class="e">✍️</div><div><b>5 days before</b><span>Write your message. Ranti drafts it: warm, funny, prayerful or short.</span></div></div>
    <div class="rung"><div class="e">📞</div><div><b>1 day before</b><span>Plan the call.</span></div></div>
    <div class="rung"><div class="e">🎉</div><div><b>On the day, 7am</b><span>Send your wishes on WhatsApp with one tap.</span></div></div>
    <div class="rung"><div class="e">📴</div><div><b>Works offline</b><span>Your dates stay on your phone. No account, no data needed.</span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>The app</h2>
  __REAL__
  <p class="cap">Concept screens</p>
  <div class="shots">
    <img src="/shots/01-lockscreen.jpg" alt="Nightly question on the lock screen" loading="lazy">
    <img src="/shots/02-capture.jpg" alt="Quick capture" loading="lazy">
    <img src="/shots/03-home.jpg" alt="Home with countdown" loading="lazy">
