<section>
  <h2>Install in 1 minute</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <ol>
      <li>Tap <b>Download for Android</b> above.</li>
      <li>Open the downloaded file. If asked, allow <b>“Install unknown apps”</b> for your browser or Files app, then tap <b>Install</b>.</li>
      <li>If Play Protect asks, tap <b>More details → Install anyway</b>.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:28px">First launch: 4 taps that matter</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <ol>
      <li><b>Allow notifications</b>, so reminders can reach you.</li>
      <li><b>Alarms &amp; reminders</b>: allow, so they ring on time.</li>
      <li><b>Autostart</b>: switch Ranti <b>ON</b> (Xiaomi / Redmi / POCO).</li>
      <li><b>Battery saver</b>: choose <b>No restrictions</b> for Ranti.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="note">Ranti opens each of these screens for you on the last setup step, and again in Settings → “Make reminders reliable”. Use <b>Send a test reminder</b> there to check.</div>
  </div>
  <a class="btn btn2" href="/ranti.apk" download="Ranti-0.1.apk">⬇&nbsp; Download Ranti 0.1</a>
</section>
